    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "And the big question everyone is\nasking—what’s the outlook for\nAI-related demand in the PCB\nspace?",
    "start": 17.613,
    "end": 23.789,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "AI-related demand",
      "PCB space"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "Management is very positive. They\nsee strong and rising end demand\nfor AI PCBs, and they’re backing\nthat up with aggressive capacity",
    "start": 24.149,
    "end": 27.957,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "AI PCBs",
