    "end": 31.765,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "AI PCBs",
      "capacity expansion"
    ],
    "page_index": 2,
    "page_count": 2
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "But is this just about volume, or\nis there something more structural\nhappening?",
    "start": 32.125,
    "end": 36.258,
    "voice_id": "XZEfcFyBnzsNJrdvkWdI",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "volume",
      "structural"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_B",
    "text": "It’s both. The report highlights\nthree key drivers. First, the AI\ninfrastructure upcycle is\naccelerating.",
    "start": 36.618,
    "end": 42.516,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "three key drivers",
      "AI infrastructure upcycle"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "EN_A",
    "text": "That’s the big picture. But what\nspecifically is driving the PCB\ndemand within that?",
